        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    mean = 0.05\n    std_dev = 0.02\n    x = 0.07\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the probability density\n    import math\n    exponent = -((x - mean) ** 2) / (2 * std_dev ** 2)\n    probability = (1 / (math.sqrt(2 * math.pi) * std_dev)) * math.exp(exponent)\n\n    # return answer\n    return round(probability, 4)\n```",
